WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.210
Two places.

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:03.290
One learning journey.

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.930
Pro Trader Academy is where you learn.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:07.810
Explore short guides.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.190
Follow lessons.

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:10.890
Save practice notes.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:12.910
And ask your instructor questions.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:16.250
Pro Trader is your chart analysis workspace.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.970
Open the app from the website navigation to explore

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.690
the tools discussed in your lessons.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.170
The Academy and App have separate sign-ins.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.750
Joining the Academy does not open a broker account

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.250
or connect MetaTrader.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.030
Start with one lesson.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.810
Explore the relevant tool.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.810
Then return to your notes and explain what you

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:37.430
observed.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.350
Learn in the Academy.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.350
Explore in the app.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.030
Build a process you can explain.
